(6023381, 885160, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty sharp to me. Not out of focus at all, I''m afraid. Is the haze in the background supposed to be the misses focus?</td>', 'Looks pretty sharp to me. Not out of focus at all, I''m afraid. Is the haze in the background supposed to be the misses focus?', '2010-05-24 01:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
