(6024986, 884281, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like hot this is framed, which unfortunately, isn''t a great thing for this contest. It feels like the background bushes are the main subject, and you are peeking through to see them.</td>', 'I like hot this is framed, which unfortunately, isn''t a great thing for this contest. It feels like the background bushes are the main subject, and you are peeking through to see them.', '2010-05-24 22:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
