(6030613, 884525, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very pretty almost abstract, I''m sure this would look wonderful on print! I saw something very similar to this in a recent challenge, I commented at the time that I thought it was very Monet like, that''s also the case for this one and I''m wondering if it''s the same photographer (not that I remember who it was). 10 from me!</td>', 'Very pretty almost abstract, I''m sure this would look wonderful on print! I saw something very similar to this in a recent challenge, I commented at the time that I thought it was very Monet like, that''s also the case for this one and I''m wondering if it''s the same photographer (not that I remember who it was). 10 from me!', '2010-05-28 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
