(6032074, 885066, 52500, '<td valign="top">Glorious.  One of the best so far.  In fact, the more I stare at it the more it approaches perfection.  A 10 and a fav are inevitable.</td>', 'Glorious.  One of the best so far.  In fact, the more I stare at it the more it approaches perfection.  A 10 and a fav are inevitable.', '2010-05-29 23:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032079, 885161, 69246, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Though, it may be a little too out of focus. If you brought it back, just slightly, I think it would help.</td>', 'Good shot. Though, it may be a little too out of focus. If you brought it back, just slightly, I think it would help.', '2010-05-29 23:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032080, 884954, 52500, '<td valign="top">This shot is totally insane.  I have no idea what''s going on, but of course that''s part of the charm.  It really can''t get much better than this.  The rainbows, the amazing shapes, the girl wandering by, it''s all just perfect.  The watery insanity makes it hard to tell, but I''m gonna guess this is a lensbaby shot.  Really, really well done.  A 10 from me.  Wait, make that a 10 and a fav. :)</td>', 'This shot is totally insane.  I have no idea what''s going on, but of course that''s part of the charm.  It really can''t get much better than this.  The rainbows, the amazing shapes, the girl wandering by, it''s all just perfect.  The watery insanity makes it hard to tell, but I''m gonna guess this is a lensbaby shot.  Really, really well done.  A 10 from me.  Wait, make that a 10 and a fav. :)', '2010-05-29 23:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032084, 885079, 69246, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where the "missed focus" is.</td>', 'I''m not sure where the "missed focus" is.', '2010-05-29 23:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032092, 885090, 52500, '<td valign="top">Man there are some good lensbaby shots in this challenge!  I guess I should''ve busted mine out.  I''m not really sure it matters much what''s in focus here, so I''m not sure how missed the focus is.  I''m not too worried about it, though.  This image is just too good to care that much about the fine details of the challenge topic.  The colors and composition really captivate me.  The backlighting is really what makes the shot, though.  I can''t believe how many 10s and favs I''ve found in this challenge!  Well, just 3 so far. :)</td>', 'Man there are some good lensbaby shots in this challenge!  I guess I should''ve busted mine out.  I''m not really sure it matters much what''s in focus here, so I''m not sure how missed the focus is.  I''m not too worried about it, though.  This image is just too good to care that much about the fine details of the challenge topic.  The colors and composition really captivate me.  The backlighting is really what makes the shot, though.  I can''t believe how many 10s and favs I''ve found in this challenge!  Well, just 3 so far. :)', '2010-05-30 00:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032093, 884645, 52500, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a damn cute kitty picture.  Very nice.</td>', 'Now that''s a damn cute kitty picture.  Very nice.', '2010-05-30 00:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032096, 884416, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s one of the coolest fish tanks I''ve ever seen.  I love me a good fish shot, and this is no exception.  Fantastic.</td>', 'That''s one of the coolest fish tanks I''ve ever seen.  I love me a good fish shot, and this is no exception.  Fantastic.', '2010-05-30 00:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032101, 884992, 52500, '<td valign="top">Just in case no one else tells you, that''s a damselfly.  Decent shot, but something about the color and/or contrast seems off.  Good composition, though.</td>', 'Just in case no one else tells you, that''s a damselfly.  Decent shot, but something about the color and/or contrast seems off.  Good composition, though.', '2010-05-30 00:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032111, 885007, 6870, '<td valign="top">Extreme composition for sure, but I kind of like it. The fence posts divide everything up into some kind of pseudocubist enterprise. 7</td>', 'Extreme composition for sure, but I kind of like it. The fence posts divide everything up into some kind of pseudocubist enterprise. 7', '2010-05-30 00:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032112, 885315, 52500, '<td valign="top">Another awesome lensbaby shot!?  How can it be?  This is really beautiful, both visually and emotionally.  I think I''ve found 4 10/favs so far.  Just amazing.</td>', 'Another awesome lensbaby shot!?  How can it be?  This is really beautiful, both visually and emotionally.  I think I''ve found 4 10/favs so far.  Just amazing.', '2010-05-30 00:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032121, 885113, 67237, '<td valign="top">deep blacks kind of hurt the sense of quietness..other that that interesting use of oof...6</td>', 'deep blacks kind of hurt the sense of quietness..other that that interesting use of oof...6', '2010-05-30 00:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032156, 884407, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous and exactly what I think this challenge is all about. The lines, composition, and colors are so strong that they carry the photo without the need of a focused subject. I can see how someone could have accidentally "missed" their focus and as a result captured this scene. Very inspirational.</td>', 'This is gorgeous and exactly what I think this challenge is all about. The lines, composition, and colors are so strong that they carry the photo without the need of a focused subject. I can see how someone could have accidentally "missed" their focus and as a result captured this scene. Very inspirational.', '2010-05-30 00:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032211, 884077, 60173, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and composition. I think a slightly tighter crop may have added more impact, but I see what you were going for.</td>', 'Nice lines and composition. I think a slightly tighter crop may have added more impact, but I see what you were going for.', '2010-05-30 02:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032212, 885157, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like the feel and processing of this, but there''s something bothering me. When I think of a clothesline I think of clothing being hung to dry. You wouldn''t hang items up to dry on hangers. The only time I''ve seen clothing hung out like this on hangers is during a yard sale, and that completely kills the dreamy, crisp air feeling for me.</td>', 'I like the feel and processing of this, but there''s something bothering me. When I think of a clothesline I think of clothing being hung to dry. You wouldn''t hang items up to dry on hangers. The only time I''ve seen clothing hung out like this on hangers is during a yard sale, and that completely kills the dreamy, crisp air feeling for me.', '2010-05-30 02:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032213, 885298, 60173, '<td valign="top">Obviously very grainy, but it has good bones.</td>', 'Obviously very grainy, but it has good bones.', '2010-05-30 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032215, 885348, 60173, '<td valign="top">The black bar border does nothing for this photo. It''s there, but it honestly just fades away. Perhaps if it were thicker it would serve some purpose? It doesn''t affect the score I''m choosing for you though.</td>', 'The black bar border does nothing for this photo. It''s there, but it honestly just fades away. Perhaps if it were thicker it would serve some purpose? It doesn''t affect the score I''m choosing for you though.', '2010-05-30 02:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032216, 885216, 60173, '<td valign="top">Grainy, but still very pretty.</td>', 'Grainy, but still very pretty.', '2010-05-30 02:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032217, 885120, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve allowed the yellow windows to pop out. It balances the photo nicely.</td>', 'I like how you''ve allowed the yellow windows to pop out. It balances the photo nicely.', '2010-05-30 02:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032219, 884661, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, but I don''t buy it as a "missed focus". The focus is perfect on the flower, and this type of shot would typically be shot in this fashion. I''m still scoring it highly, but for that reason (as much as it pains me to do so) I''m knocking the score down lower than if it were a Freestudy.</td>', 'I really like this photo, but I don''t buy it as a "missed focus". The focus is perfect on the flower, and this type of shot would typically be shot in this fashion. I''m still scoring it highly, but for that reason (as much as it pains me to do so) I''m knocking the score down lower than if it were a Freestudy.', '2010-05-30 02:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032220, 885294, 60173, '<td valign="top">Incredibly grainy in the wrong way. Composition is nice, and it fits the challenge through.</td>', 'Incredibly grainy in the wrong way. Composition is nice, and it fits the challenge through.', '2010-05-30 02:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032223, 884875, 60173, '<td valign="top">Lots of color banding, which leads me to believe you pushed your photo farther than it was willing to go in processing. It does however fit the challenge well.</td>', 'Lots of color banding, which leads me to believe you pushed your photo farther than it was willing to go in processing. It does however fit the challenge well.', '2010-05-30 02:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032224, 884630, 60173, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge, but isn''t all that appealing.</td>', 'This fits the challenge, but isn''t all that appealing.', '2010-05-30 02:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032228, 884288, 60173, '<td valign="top">The focus is indeed missed, but I don''t think the result is an image that is better than if you would have hit your mark. Literally this photo fits the challenge, but in my voting I''m looking for photos where the missed focus has a significance or the work can stand alone outside of this challenge. This just leaves me wishing the focus were on the horses were it should be.</td>', 'The focus is indeed missed, but I don''t think the result is an image that is better than if you would have hit your mark. Literally this photo fits the challenge, but in my voting I''m looking for photos where the missed focus has a significance or the work can stand alone outside of this challenge. This just leaves me wishing the focus were on the horses were it should be.', '2010-05-30 02:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032229, 884624, 60173, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, but isn''t appealing.</td>', 'Fits the challenge, but isn''t appealing.', '2010-05-30 02:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032232, 885079, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think the focus in this is where someone would typically focus, so in a way slightly doesn''t fit the challenge in my eyes. I''m still scoring it well, but not as high as I would if it were in a Freestudy challenge for instance.</td>', 'I think the focus in this is where someone would typically focus, so in a way slightly doesn''t fit the challenge in my eyes. I''m still scoring it well, but not as high as I would if it were in a Freestudy challenge for instance.', '2010-05-30 02:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032233, 884757, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is oddly appealing, even though I don''t really know what I''m looking at.</td>', 'This is oddly appealing, even though I don''t really know what I''m looking at.', '2010-05-30 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032234, 883716, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better if it were flipped horizontally so that the flower were on the left.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better if it were flipped horizontally so that the flower were on the left.', '2010-05-30 02:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032235, 883380, 60173, '<td valign="top">Not terribly interesting. It fits the literal challenge discription and is well composed I suppose.</td>', 'Not terribly interesting. It fits the literal challenge discription and is well composed I suppose.', '2010-05-30 02:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032236, 885061, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but I don''t see it as a "Missed Focus".</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but I don''t see it as a "Missed Focus".', '2010-05-30 02:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032237, 885322, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''d imagine it''s very hard (impossible) to focus on a subject that is behind textured glass. For that reason I don''t feel this meets the spirit of the challenge in being a "missed focus". I do like the look that the textured glass has created on the subject''s face though.</td>', 'I''d imagine it''s very hard (impossible) to focus on a subject that is behind textured glass. For that reason I don''t feel this meets the spirit of the challenge in being a "missed focus". I do like the look that the textured glass has created on the subject''s face though.', '2010-05-30 02:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032238, 884446, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s no richness to the colors. The light is harsh, and the whites are blown out.</td>', 'There''s no richness to the colors. The light is harsh, and the whites are blown out.', '2010-05-30 02:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032239, 885341, 60173, '<td valign="top">Looks a little underexposed to me.</td>', 'Looks a little underexposed to me.', '2010-05-30 02:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032240, 884957, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is a little too blurred, and the flowers have almost become just colored balls. The problem with that being the composition isn''t strong enough to support just colored balls.</td>', 'This is a little too blurred, and the flowers have almost become just colored balls. The problem with that being the composition isn''t strong enough to support just colored balls.', '2010-05-30 02:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032241, 884210, 60173, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped higher to eliminate the black line in the lower right corner.</td>', 'I would have cropped higher to eliminate the black line in the lower right corner.', '2010-05-30 02:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032243, 885163, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''d say this meets the challenge, but there''s a bit of a processing issue (green/red glow) and the composition seems uninspired.</td>', 'I''d say this meets the challenge, but there''s a bit of a processing issue (green/red glow) and the composition seems uninspired.', '2010-05-30 02:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032244, 884836, 60173, '<td valign="top">Focus looks fine to me. I''m not sure I''d believe you expected to get the flowers in focus with those vases in front like that. It''s a nice photo, but I don''t think it meets the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Focus looks fine to me. I''m not sure I''d believe you expected to get the flowers in focus with those vases in front like that. It''s a nice photo, but I don''t think it meets the spirit of the challenge.', '2010-05-30 02:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032245, 884606, 60173, '<td valign="top">Processing is over the top and doesn''t seem to be controlled or serving any purpose.</td>', 'Processing is over the top and doesn''t seem to be controlled or serving any purpose.', '2010-05-30 02:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032246, 885351, 60173, '<td valign="top">In the wide world of photography this shot might seem creative and impressive, but in all honesty I''m so burnt out on seeing it. It sounds weird to say this shot is cliche, but due to all the drama that surround the original version I''m pretty done with seeing anything interesting about it. Also, this isn''t as well executed as the originals. There''s motion blur on the glass, and a lot of grain.</td>', 'In the wide world of photography this shot might seem creative and impressive, but in all honesty I''m so burnt out on seeing it. It sounds weird to say this shot is cliche, but due to all the drama that surround the original version I''m pretty done with seeing anything interesting about it. Also, this isn''t as well executed as the originals. There''s motion blur on the glass, and a lot of grain.', '2010-05-30 02:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032247, 883281, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of motion blur. Nicely done and it enhances the image, but the subject is missed focus.</td>', 'I see a lot of motion blur. Nicely done and it enhances the image, but the subject is missed focus.', '2010-05-30 02:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032248, 883853, 60173, '<td valign="top">My first thought when looking at this is "motion blur" not "missed focus". There''s also quite a bit of grain that I don''t think adds to the mood or feel of the photo.</td>', 'My first thought when looking at this is "motion blur" not "missed focus". There''s also quite a bit of grain that I don''t think adds to the mood or feel of the photo.', '2010-05-30 02:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032249, 884281, 60173, '<td valign="top">Are those blooms on the tree or highlights?</td>', 'Are those blooms on the tree or highlights?', '2010-05-30 02:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032250, 884778, 60173, '<td valign="top">I can''t get past the piece of grass covering his eye. It''s completely stopping me from connecting at all with the scene.</td>', 'I can''t get past the piece of grass covering his eye. It''s completely stopping me from connecting at all with the scene.', '2010-05-30 02:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032252, 884702, 60173, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect with the umbrella. To me the blur in this shot however is more motion blur than a "missed focus".</td>', 'Very cool effect with the umbrella. To me the blur in this shot however is more motion blur than a "missed focus".', '2010-05-30 02:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032253, 884610, 60173, '<td valign="top">I believe that this is a "missed focus", but I honestly can''t say I''m terribly interested in a "proposed site for bookshelves." I suppose the lighting and exposure is nice, and it does look like a good place for some shelves.</td>', 'I believe that this is a "missed focus", but I honestly can''t say I''m terribly interested in a "proposed site for bookshelves." I suppose the lighting and exposure is nice, and it does look like a good place for some shelves.', '2010-05-30 02:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032254, 884930, 60173, '<td valign="top">The subject in this photo is the word "missed", and the subject in the description of the challenge was supposed to be out of focus. It''s not a bad photo, but it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'The subject in this photo is the word "missed", and the subject in the description of the challenge was supposed to be out of focus. It''s not a bad photo, but it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2010-05-30 02:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032255, 884861, 60173, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what the subject is or why it would be your subject.</td>', 'I have no idea what the subject is or why it would be your subject.', '2010-05-30 02:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032291, 885005, 118057, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the focus is on the rope rather than the boxer.</td>', 'Nice, I like the focus is on the rope rather than the boxer.', '2010-05-30 05:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032298, 885130, 93565, '<td valign="top">While I think this would be an awesome shot in focus, it doesn''t strike me as anything more than an intentionally unfocused shot. Something else to focus on would have helped, especially if the OOF object wasn''t the sole object in the frame.</td>', 'While I think this would be an awesome shot in focus, it doesn''t strike me as anything more than an intentionally unfocused shot. Something else to focus on would have helped, especially if the OOF object wasn''t the sole object in the frame.', '2010-05-30 05:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032299, 884441, 93565, '<td valign="top">Super cool photo. The moody lighting with the dark on the right really helps things along. Great entry- expect to see it at the top.</td>', 'Super cool photo. The moody lighting with the dark on the right really helps things along. Great entry- expect to see it at the top.', '2010-05-30 05:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032303, 885096, 93565, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally see how the missed focus has added anything to this shot. There is no clear focus for the viewer to be drawn to, leaving me wondering what the intention really was.</td>', 'I don''t personally see how the missed focus has added anything to this shot. There is no clear focus for the viewer to be drawn to, leaving me wondering what the intention really was.', '2010-05-30 05:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032306, 884606, 93565, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a good scene going here, that much is clear. However, I don''t feel like the photo would have been better by focusing on the "subject" of the photo. The dandelion pales in comparison to that which is behind it. If I had taken this photo, I would have depressed the dandelion so it didn''t ruin my shot, not make it a central focus.. You also appear have some haloing around the central trees.</td>', 'You''ve got a good scene going here, that much is clear. However, I don''t feel like the photo would have been better by focusing on the "subject" of the photo. The dandelion pales in comparison to that which is behind it. If I had taken this photo, I would have depressed the dandelion so it didn''t ruin my shot, not make it a central focus.. You also appear have some haloing around the central trees.', '2010-05-30 05:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032307, 885110, 93565, '<td valign="top">To me, this is another example of a meaningless missed focus. The lack of focus does not benefit the photo. Considering the ruleset, a more effective approach would be to choose either foreground or background (infinity) focus and then exaggerate it in processing.</td>', 'To me, this is another example of a meaningless missed focus. The lack of focus does not benefit the photo. Considering the ruleset, a more effective approach would be to choose either foreground or background (infinity) focus and then exaggerate it in processing.', '2010-05-30 05:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032309, 884836, 93565, '<td valign="top">I don''t particuarly understand how this is missed focus, as the glass objects clearly have defined texture. It is only the background that is not focused... which would have been werid if you had focused on that in the first place?</td>', 'I don''t particuarly understand how this is missed focus, as the glass objects clearly have defined texture. It is only the background that is not focused... which would have been werid if you had focused on that in the first place?', '2010-05-30 05:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032310, 884826, 93565, '<td valign="top">Hooray! An entry which uses an improper focal point to amplify the meaning of a single element. Good choice, and that grandiose hat is certainly a subject in and of itself.</td>', 'Hooray! An entry which uses an improper focal point to amplify the meaning of a single element. Good choice, and that grandiose hat is certainly a subject in and of itself.', '2010-05-30 05:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032312, 884861, 93565, '<td valign="top">Guessing from the photo, I''m looking at a bow and arrow, with the place where the sight is aimed in focus? Cool effect, but I fear too many will miss what this is.</td>', 'Guessing from the photo, I''m looking at a bow and arrow, with the place where the sight is aimed in focus? Cool effect, but I fear too many will miss what this is.', '2010-05-30 05:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032314, 885193, 93565, '<td valign="top">While there are certainly lensbaby shots that I love, I have a hard time justifying this one''s place in the missed focus challenge, as nothing is in focus and I feel like the lensbaby could have been utilized much better.</td>', 'While there are certainly lensbaby shots that I love, I have a hard time justifying this one''s place in the missed focus challenge, as nothing is in focus and I feel like the lensbaby could have been utilized much better.', '2010-05-30 05:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032315, 884283, 93565, '<td valign="top">Good fit for challenge, but would have preferred a bit more blur to the supposed subjects. Lower aperture/longer focal length lens may have helped exaggerate this, as would gaussian blur.</td>', 'Good fit for challenge, but would have preferred a bit more blur to the supposed subjects. Lower aperture/longer focal length lens may have helped exaggerate this, as would gaussian blur.', '2010-05-30 05:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032317, 885258, 93565, '<td valign="top">I feel like this could''ve been a very cool minimalist shot, by focussing on the water''s surface perhaps between the leaves using an extension tube. As is, it''s just a blurry shot with no isolation.</td>', 'I feel like this could''ve been a very cool minimalist shot, by focussing on the water''s surface perhaps between the leaves using an extension tube. As is, it''s just a blurry shot with no isolation.', '2010-05-30 05:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032318, 884847, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like the mirror images. Sorta wish the right flower was sharper though.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like the mirror images. Sorta wish the right flower was sharper though.', '2010-05-30 05:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032320, 885294, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m venturing out and guessing we have some aborgines in the background? Or at indiginous people from somewhere...<br/>I like the sentiment. I''m not really sure how I would have done this; Less blur to make sure people know what we''re looking at, but then that deceases the message. Tough choice, but I do like the direction quite a bit.</td>', 'I''m venturing out and guessing we have some aborgines in the background? Or at indiginous people from somewhere...I like the sentiment. I''m not really sure how I would have done this; Less blur to make sure people know what we''re looking at, but then that deceases the message. Tough choice, but I do like the direction quite a bit.', '2010-05-30 05:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032325, 884869, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like how the dirt is almost in focus but perhaps not quite. The nature of this adds to the shot nicely. Non-centered composition might have helped things a bit, but I like it.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like how the dirt is almost in focus but perhaps not quite. The nature of this adds to the shot nicely. Non-centered composition might have helped things a bit, but I like it.', '2010-05-30 05:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032327, 885302, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blue to emphasize the moment. The bird flying and the blurred nature of things really work well together.</td>', 'Nice use of blue to emphasize the moment. The bird flying and the blurred nature of things really work well together.', '2010-05-30 05:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032329, 884592, 93565, '<td valign="top">I seriously do not understand the context you were trying to portray here. There is not even a title to help the viewer along in terms of finding your direction. What is the focus? Why is he holding a book? Why is he doing this when she''s sweeping? There''s nowhere for the viewer to look and comprehend the scene, no cultural reference points.</td>', 'I seriously do not understand the context you were trying to portray here. There is not even a title to help the viewer along in terms of finding your direction. What is the focus? Why is he holding a book? Why is he doing this when she''s sweeping? There''s nowhere for the viewer to look and comprehend the scene, no cultural reference points.', '2010-05-30 05:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032332, 884923, 93565, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m guessing you''re being slammed by voteres. There have been a good number of these types of photos on DPC over the years, and this one doesn''t bring a whole lot to the table. You don''t have a clearly defined subject... should we focus on the brutality of the murderer or the innocence of the victim? They are equal in your depiction. Black eye seems a bit overdone, but I like the lighting. However, I don''t understand how she''s bound but hands are free? Did she "escape" her restraints then? If so, her posture doesn''t follow this assumption.</td>', 'Well, I''m guessing you''re being slammed by voteres. There have been a good number of these types of photos on DPC over the years, and this one doesn''t bring a whole lot to the table. You don''t have a clearly defined subject... should we focus on the brutality of the murderer or the innocence of the victim? They are equal in your depiction. Black eye seems a bit overdone, but I like the lighting. However, I don''t understand how she''s bound but hands are free? Did she "escape" her restraints then? If so, her posture doesn''t follow this assumption.', '2010-05-30 05:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032333, 885317, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cool lurking shot. The odd shape of the silhouette realy adds to his. The downward stairwell does as well. Good job.</td>', 'Cool lurking shot. The odd shape of the silhouette realy adds to his. The downward stairwell does as well. Good job.', '2010-05-30 05:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032335, 885120, 93565, '<td valign="top">Honestly, when your shot started loading, I thought "boy, another shot with nothing at all in focus. What am I going to say this time?"<br/>But, after waiting for things, the juxtaposition of the two is nice. I like it quite a bit. Good job.</td>', 'Honestly, when your shot started loading, I thought "boy, another shot with nothing at all in focus. What am I going to say this time?"But, after waiting for things, the juxtaposition of the two is nice. I like it quite a bit. Good job.', '2010-05-30 05:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032339, 885296, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but connection to challenge would''ve been greatly strenghened by subject eing posed in a proper spot for a portrait, only out of focus.</td>', 'I like the idea, but connection to challenge would''ve been greatly strenghened by subject eing posed in a proper spot for a portrait, only out of focus.', '2010-05-30 06:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032349, 884851, 59279, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the "missed" focus, especially the OOF model''s great defensive posture!</td>', 'I like this take on the "missed" focus, especially the OOF model''s great defensive posture!', '2010-05-30 06:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032350, 884923, 59279, '<td valign="top">Gives me chills. Horribly emotive. Excellent work</td>', 'Gives me chills. Horribly emotive. Excellent work', '2010-05-30 07:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032365, 884903, 117809, '<td valign="top">the colors of this really stand out. but, im not quite sure what im supposed to be looking at.</td>', 'the colors of this really stand out. but, im not quite sure what im supposed to be looking at.', '2010-05-30 09:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032367, 883924, 117809, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2010-05-30 09:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032372, 885126, 65468, '<td valign="top">So far the first that meets the challenge IMHO-8</td>', 'So far the first that meets the challenge IMHO-8', '2010-05-30 09:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032377, 883898, 65468, '<td valign="top">This could have been a better entry if the window area was in sharp focus it appears to be an chance to use a lens-baby but doesn''t meet the challenge IMHO.  If you shot one with her in sharp focus it would be a beautiful image for other purposes.</td>', 'This could have been a better entry if the window area was in sharp focus it appears to be an chance to use a lens-baby but doesn''t meet the challenge IMHO.  If you shot one with her in sharp focus it would be a beautiful image for other purposes.', '2010-05-30 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032378, 884909, 65468, '<td valign="top">I hope you shot this in focus also.</td>', 'I hope you shot this in focus also.', '2010-05-30 09:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032380, 884645, 117559, '<td valign="top">If I could vote I would give this a 10.  Love it.</td>', 'If I could vote I would give this a 10.  Love it.', '2010-05-30 09:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032382, 885227, 65468, '<td valign="top">At first I thought another totally blurred image then I read the title.  Great timing on the fly, one of the few that has met the challenge in my opinion.-8</td>', 'At first I thought another totally blurred image then I read the title.  Great timing on the fly, one of the few that has met the challenge in my opinion.-8', '2010-05-30 09:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032389, 885203, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the high key.</td>', 'I like the high key.', '2010-05-30 10:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032400, 885350, 100831, '<td valign="top">Me thinks this might be more along the line of motion blur... but.. I love it so... let me think some more. Yup, it''s motion blur but that won''t affect my score because of the lines and color. 7</td>', 'Me thinks this might be more along the line of motion blur... but.. I love it so... let me think some more. Yup, it''s motion blur but that won''t affect my score because of the lines and color. 7', '2010-05-30 10:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032401, 884849, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I like that you left the authentically mis-skewed window frame alone.</td>', 'Excellent! I like that you left the authentically mis-skewed window frame alone.', '2010-05-30 10:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032403, 884841, 100831, '<td valign="top">I guess they do kind of look like hands waving. Love the photo.</td>', 'I guess they do kind of look like hands waving. Love the photo.', '2010-05-30 10:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032405, 885005, 7743, '<td valign="top">This would be improved if the OOF figure was actually framed by the ropes.</td>', 'This would be improved if the OOF figure was actually framed by the ropes.', '2010-05-30 10:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032407, 884574, 7743, '<td valign="top">The background is like a painting.  I think this would be even better if the rocks were also OOF.</td>', 'The background is like a painting.  I think this would be even better if the rocks were also OOF.', '2010-05-30 10:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032408, 884908, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good idea with the framing but nothing is being framed.  If a boat were out there then this would be much better.</td>', 'Good idea with the framing but nothing is being framed.  If a boat were out there then this would be much better.', '2010-05-30 10:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032409, 885285, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice soft tones.  Just a touch more DOF I think would improve this as the subject would have a bit more definition.</td>', 'Nice soft tones.  Just a touch more DOF I think would improve this as the subject would have a bit more definition.', '2010-05-30 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032411, 885037, 7743, '<td valign="top">The rope doesn''t provide enough of a framing element so I think the image would be better without it.  Maybe slightly less DOF to put the boats a little bit more OOF.</td>', 'The rope doesn''t provide enough of a framing element so I think the image would be better without it.  Maybe slightly less DOF to put the boats a little bit more OOF.', '2010-05-30 10:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032412, 884760, 7743, '<td valign="top">A little bit more DOF to give a bit more definition in the lion but less grass as to me the grass is a distraction.  Like the painterly feel of the lion though.</td>', 'A little bit more DOF to give a bit more definition in the lion but less grass as to me the grass is a distraction.  Like the painterly feel of the lion though.', '2010-05-30 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032413, 885149, 7743, '<td valign="top">Very moody image.  I think it would be improved if the left side of his face were not so dark.</td>', 'Very moody image.  I think it would be improved if the left side of his face were not so dark.', '2010-05-30 10:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032416, 885145, 109478, '<td valign="top">Great color</td>', 'Great color', '2010-05-30 11:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032425, 885122, 50695, '<td valign="top">What Is Art? Art is the muddying of the personal, the covering of the personal with what ultimately becomes a cognitive layer, even if it is the cognition of dreamtime. Art has no eyes. Art holds itself holding itself.</td>', 'What Is Art? Art is the muddying of the personal, the covering of the personal with what ultimately becomes a cognitive layer, even if it is the cognition of dreamtime. Art has no eyes. Art holds itself holding itself.', '2010-05-30 11:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032426, 885297, 50695, '<td valign="top">What Is Art? Art slashes across the mundane. Art slashes across itself after it has already become mundane. Art is the opposite of preservation.</td>', 'What Is Art? Art slashes across the mundane. Art slashes across itself after it has already become mundane. Art is the opposite of preservation.', '2010-05-30 11:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032427, 885357, 50695, '<td valign="top">What Is Art? Art is what''s there after everything else is gone. Art is the wind everyone is trying to catch.</td>', 'What Is Art? Art is what''s there after everything else is gone. Art is the wind everyone is trying to catch.', '2010-05-30 11:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032428, 885109, 50695, '<td valign="top">What Is Art? Art is a fence on experience, the fence held by what it contains. Art has one eye, and sees sideways.</td>', 'What Is Art? Art is a fence on experience, the fence held by what it contains. Art has one eye, and sees sideways.', '2010-05-30 11:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032430, 884900, 50695, '<td valign="top">What Is Art? Art is an edifice with no walls, but to forget that it is still an edifice would be wrong. Art is the digression of worship toward something nearer.</td>', 'What Is Art? Art is an edifice with no walls, but to forget that it is still an edifice would be wrong. Art is the digression of worship toward something nearer.', '2010-05-30 11:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032431, 884051, 50695, '<td valign="top">What Is Art? Art is obscene allegory. Art is a romance of the absurd. Art looks back at us while the artwork walks away.</td>', 'What Is Art? Art is obscene allegory. Art is a romance of the absurd. Art looks back at us while the artwork walks away.', '2010-05-30 11:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032559, 884312, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very creative on setting up the glasses to create out of focus but adding focus.  One of my top picks.  Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Very creative on setting up the glasses to create out of focus but adding focus.  One of my top picks.  Hope this does well for you.', '2010-05-30 17:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032562, 884379, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the out of focus aspect of this image.  The sweep of the blur, the sun above the horizon, and the silhouette of the person creates a dramatic photo (at least for me).</td>', 'I like the out of focus aspect of this image.  The sweep of the blur, the sun above the horizon, and the silhouette of the person creates a dramatic photo (at least for me).', '2010-05-30 18:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032573, 883131, 115096, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but I don''t like the border...</td>', 'Nice photo but I don''t like the border...', '2010-05-30 18:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6032578, 885350, 115096, '<td valign="top">Were you trying to focus on the wall?</td>', 'Were you trying to focus on the wall?', '2010-05-30 18:45:01.000000', NULL, 1);
