(6033335, 885131, 40391, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth I''m suprised this finished as low as it did but I didn''t find it all that interesting and I would never had guessed was one of yours.  Unfortunately, it relied on the title to let me know that the car wasn''t your intended subject, which to me wasn''t obvious. What I really like was the perspective and the sky - especially that reflected on the car. It would have loved to had seen more of the jets in the car''s reflection.<br/> <br/>At least when you only get one comment you get to know exactly what that person voted. By the way, thanks for my lowest vote ;-)  Seriously, thanks for my comment as it did make me look at my shot differently and I could see where you were comming from.  Also, in all fairness I''ll let you know my vote - a 4 - and having spent more time looking at it now I feel I was a bit harsh (only a bit). Cheers.<br/> <br/></td>', 'For what it''s worth I''m suprised this finished as low as it did but I didn''t find it all that interesting and I would never had guessed was one of yours.  Unfortunately, it relied on the title to let me know that the car wasn''t your intended subject, which to me wasn''t obvious. What I really like was the perspective and the sky - especially that reflected on the car. It would have loved to had seen more of the jets in the car''s reflection. At least when you only get one comment you get to know exactly what that person voted. By the way, thanks for my lowest vote ;-)  Seriously, thanks for my comment as it did make me look at my shot differently and I could see where you were comming from.  Also, in all fairness I''ll let you know my vote - a 4 - and having spent more time looking at it now I feel I was a bit harsh (only a bit). Cheers. ', '2010-05-31 06:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
